        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "Okay, just so I'm perfectly clear on this, when playing The Chairman;\n\n1) At the end of the villain turn, Operative brings out an underboss. The turn is over, the underboss's end of turn effect does not activate.\n\nor\n\n2) Operative brings out an underboss, it is still the end of the villain turn, so the underboss's end of turn effect is activated, bringing out a thug, which also has an end of turn effect, and that effect is activated too.\n\nThis has been driving me and my friends insane.",
