        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/58956e/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-04-04T15:21:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>My feelings are that until ALL the Villain end of turn effects have been resolved the Villains end of turn cannot be completed. This includes any cards played during the Villains end of turn. I think it would also apply to Heroes and Environments as well.</p>",
